Mirrors what the site now sends, against the rating_app goal of this counter. The service, the action and the agent slug travel as visit parameters:

  ym(103663306, 'reachGoal', 'rating_app', {
    rating: { esim: { agent_page: 'yesim' } }
  });

Nested rather than three flat keys, so the Параметры визитов report can be drilled section, then action, then agent.

All eight sections open the same AgentDrawer, and the section and slug already live in the address (?section=&item=), so the drawer reads them from useAppNavigation and none of the eight explorers had to change. Outbound clicks go through one goToAgentSite, which covers the main button and the promo codes alike — both are the same departure to the agent's site.

Verified in the browser across ved, esim, microloans, payment-services and virtual-cards: one event on open, one on click, including promo codes.

